    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_2070_rival_09",
      "hash64": "8753B558BF439C03",
      "text": "Es el nombre oficial del torneo, por cierto.\\n¿A que es genial?[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 62,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_2070_rival_10",
      "hash64": "8756C258BF45E7F1",
      "text": "A Damián no le entusiasmó y empezó a referirse\\na él como la guerra del patio...[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_2070_rival_11",
      "hash64": "8756C158BF45E63E",
      "text": "Hasta oí al director Clavel llamándolo así,\\n¡estoy que me subo por las paredes![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 79,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_2070_rival_03",
      "hash64": "8753BF58BF43AD01",
      "text": "Bueno, ¿y tú qué, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]?\\n¿Preparad[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]oa para competir?[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 55,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_2070_rival_04a",
      "hash64": "36FEABCD000213EF",
      "text": "¡Así se habla, y además con convicción!\\c\\nTengo muchas ganas de contemplar la verdadera\\nfuerza de un[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0A08)] Campeóna Campeona como tú.[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 101,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0A08"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 133,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_2070_rival_04b",
      "hash64": "36FEACCD000215A2",
      "text": "¡Ja, ja! ¡Pero mira que eres bromista! Anda, no\\nme vengas en plan \"todavía no soy persona\".[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 91,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_2070_rival_05",
      "hash64": "8753C158BF43B067",
      "text": "Además, gracias a ti vamos a contar con una\\ninvitada de lujo: la súper. ¡Toma ya![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 4,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_2070_rival_06",
      "hash64": "8753C258BF43B21A",
      "text": "Yo estaré muy liada entre bambalinas con la\\norganización del torneo, así que mucho me\\r\\ntemo que no podré participar.[VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 118,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_2070_rival_07",
      "hash64": "8753C358BF43B3CD",
      "text": "Pero mira, mejor que mejor. ¡Así podré analizar\\ntu fuerza de forma objetiva![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0004"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_2070_rival_08",
      "hash64": "8753B458BF439A50",
      "text": "Bueno, primero debes registrarte en secretaría,\\nasí que nos vemos en el vestíbulo. ¡No tardes![VAR 0x0114(0004)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
